WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.336
[plane landing]

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:10.243
[suspenseful music]

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.914
OFFICER MARRERO: We're going
to run all these boxes.

00:00:14.981 --> 00:00:18.551
Through the mail facility,
we get narcotics every day.

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.353
You name it, we've
seen it loaded.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:24.391
Sneakers, coffee beans,
radios, hard drives,

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:26.326
electronic equipment.

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:27.627
Nothing surprises us anymore.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:31.164
It's like, every day
you get something new.

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:34.667
[suspenseful music]

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:38.872
This one was a negative.

00:00:38.938 --> 00:00:39.973
Definitely not narcotics.

00:00:40.039 --> 00:00:43.410
[suspenseful music]

00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:48.815
That doesn't look good.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:50.550
OFFICER MARRERO (VOICEOVER):
And it says, sporting

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.652
goods equipment and two fans.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.487
I don't see the
reason to send fans.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.190
They got them everywhere.

00:00:57.257 --> 00:00:59.559
This package is coming
from a source country,

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:01.728
Trinidad and Tobago,
and it's going

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:04.964
to a demand country, Australia.

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:08.134
The value is very high over
there for any type of narcotic.

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:12.272
Something doesn't look right.

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.679
This seems like cheap
plastic, but in the image

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.481
it looks too thick.

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.050
The only way to really look
if you don't like the image--

00:01:24.117 --> 00:01:25.552
take a quick peek inside.

00:01:25.618 --> 00:01:28.621
[intense music]

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.495
See that, right there?

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:36.930
That's not supposed to be there.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:41.067
That's why it looks thicker
in the X-ray machine.

00:01:41.134 --> 00:01:42.802
They usually glue them in.

00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:46.473
And they're not hard to pop off.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:49.275
Try to see if we can peel
back a little bit of it,

00:01:49.342 --> 00:01:51.845
so we can see what's under it.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:55.215
And whatever it is, it's
wrapped in aluminum foil.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:01.488
See?

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:02.856
It's loaded.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:05.725
You can see that it's white.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:07.160
I'll test it real quick.

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:16.035
We should have green
with some pink above it.

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:17.837
It's hard to see
but, it's there.

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:18.705
It's positive.

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:21.774
It's cocaine.

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:24.844
We have 806.4 grams.

00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:30.316
[intense music]

00:02:30.383 --> 00:02:33.853
I can tell you what it's
going to go for now-- nothing.

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.889
One for the good guys.

